    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "«Delta AirLines\nWORLDWIDE TIMETABLE\nEffective October 1, 1996 -November 30, 1996\nЗКУМТН\nanan\n321345\nA Delta AirLines\nSkyMiles\n3731 321345\nA Delta Air Lines\nSkyMiles\nОРНІМА\n3131 321345 61008\nК В АТКІН\nT TRANS\nA Delta Air Lines\nSkyMiles\n3137 321345\nJ B ATKINS\nNOT TRANSFERABLE\nOPTIM\n61008\n96\nAMERICAN\nEXPRESS\n^ Delta Air Lines\nSkyMiles\n3137 321343 61008\n96\nOPTIMA\nAMERICAN\nEXPRESS\nJB ATKINS\nNOT TRANSFERABLE\n© AMEX\nStart Earning SkyMiles®\nFor Every Dollar You Spend.\nCall 1-800-SKY-MILE.\nFor more information, see application inside.",
      "WHEN OTHER AIRLINES\nFREQUENT FLYER MILES\n~ EXPIRE~\nWHERE DO THEY GO?\nPoof!\nIf you don't use your frequent flyer miles on some\nairlines, they magically disappear.\nBut not Delta. Just take a qualifying flight* once every\nthree years, and your SkyMiles® last forever.\nVisit our web site at http://www.delta-air.com\nA Delta AirLines\nYou'll love the way we fly\nAll standard Delta SkyMiles program rules and conditions apply. *A qualifying segment\nis one Delta/Delta Connection® flight taken once every 36 months with the purchase of\na fare that is eligible for frequent flyer mileage credit. ©1996 Delta Air Lines, Inc."
